    "show_share": true,
    "description": "President Firoz Rasul formally launched a virtual Faculty Mentorship Programme that pairs mentors from Academics Without Borders with AKU faculty mentees drawn from medicine, nursing and education. AWB members from Canada and the US, and AKU faculty members from Kenya, Tanzania and Pakistan - 25 participants in all - joined the event online.",
